  "reference": "2 Sugoodiga 7",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Oaleaydiit ginyah NG'UTAMIIDA, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, numuji damanda uurji nih aba jeeda mujiineeda Samariya gajeashaayda dearanga miyaasiin giloohaji samwagu aba shiliingajeanda was shekeeli, ea giloohaji lah bea nganooyda siguura shayiiri aba shiliingajeanda was shekeeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda shirikarajeanda haw fur sugoocheanda, ak gwayeesha siida ASEETA. “Ng'ula inyeeda gwachi NG'UTAMIIDA gwasin seawuutka humng'eeda, heapi? Ng'asheanji gwachi gaygwasa?” Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha. “Ng'ula ang'iing'i gaydaaha aba gheanyangaagu ak ea majaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lugooda Shaamu ghang'eat gaweay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwanda fih ang'wan bearji geeyooda udamusuura, nea goobiitpiit aba dooshta mujiineeda Samariya, ak iidu gaba nih anyaash nuut nea gwayeesha, “Ak gajeepiidana hiji ea eemeewa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ghamneawa iisiweayi mujiini,’ mujiini gwanda geejeeda. Abeeda gajeemeewiisiina hoowa, ak eara eepiidana hiji gajeemeewa. Ak eara eeweesiina lugooda fuga Shaamu asi eeweaya ghoang'waanyeasa abeeda gajeepiidana ama inyas ghabwareasa gajeemeewa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat gaweay nea gudea gheata beashata gil, nea abeeda gaweay museasooda fuga Shaamu. Iidu nea geahita ghuuta museasooda fuga Shaamu, siing'wearda geadaah manda eara siyagi aba hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA abeeda nibwada geat lugooda fuga Shaamu, ak geayiiy ghuuta mutukwajeega, ea faraasajeega, ea ghuuta lugooda saang'a. Hean gaba siisi eesha nuut, “Ng'ula, sugoocheanda Israeli niidaw gadiyeeda aba badaydeanya sugoodiga fuga Hiti ea sugoodiga Misri ghapka ng'ucheedeanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat fuga Shaamu, gamng'aw nea gudea misana. Nea ghwanung'wa heeda maheemajeega nyaawa, ea faraasajeega nyaawa, ea digeeniga nyaawa, ea museasooda nyaawa geenung'usiinda heeda giduurji. Ak geesalda eaghu eaweega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahita fugiga bearji geeyooda udamusuura jeeda museasooda, gaweay jeeda maheemajeanda. Ak gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi, nea geegeanda lapiya ea dahaabu siguura dahaabu, ak gaweay ghafuy. Hean geebiigu ak geeweay jeeda maheemajeanda nuut, ak geegeanda haleanjeeda ak geeweay eafuy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool geat nea gwayi, “Ng'asheesu sisinyiin mwadoabiiwa. Eanean eaweeda giijasta miy gil, inyas geasiindi ea ghoah sakteayda abeeda gajeanyasa lasooda. Asi eeweaya eerukusiina fuga gheeh sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeweay ak geeguursa furiischoodiga mujiini, ak geeyeesha, “Geahiti heeda museasooda fuga Shaamu, ak ea meadaahi eara siyagi aba hoowa nea meayiinyi eara ghuutpa sih. Geaghus faraasajeega mida ghealooniga ea digeeniga sirat, nea eara maheemajeega gawuurji gidasinung'usiinda heeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguurda furiischoodiga ak gwayeesha fuga gheeh sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat sugoocheanda nea gudea eawa gil, ak gwayeesha fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, “Gaydaahiimneegwa gida niidiing'diing'deayda geat fuga Shaamu aba badaydeanya. Ghwanal gideaba geebearjeewi jalooda, ak ghamneawa gwariteawa jeeda museasooda ak gaweay ghafuy geat, aba miy ghaang'; nea gwayeesha geat gideaba ‘iisirini jeeda mujiini ghoang'waanyeasa nea geawooschi majeekcheew ak gaweay jeeda mujiini.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda siyagi aba jeeda fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ak gwayeesha, “Asi dageana fiisu ng'ay faraasaji muut aba jeeda gea abit nea gea abit aba jeeda mujiini gawuurji eemeetuw sean bea Israeli mida jeedida, ak gawuurji eemeetuw sean bea Israeli silas uhuuda. Asi eecheakta eadaah.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geegeanu mutukwaji iyeenya ea faraasajeagaaschi hean goojeakta sugoocheanda ghwaat geeshta fuga Shaamu nea gwayeesha, “Aweayeena adaaha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geayaat geeshta ea eahita Yordani. Nea jeeda naweesean ghwanyiit hang'weaka ea haleanjeeda jakta fuga Shaamu, aba gideaba ghoamu ng'weega. Ak gabiikta fuga gwachi siicheakta ak geataw iita sugoocheanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarita buuneeda ak ghaghas museasooda fuga Shaamu. Ak giideenda dearanga miyaasiin geeshaaydaawa shekeeli, nea gideenaji iyeenya bea shayiiri gaba shekeeli aba gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayiin sugoocheanda shirikarajeandida haw gwachi fur sugoocheandean, gafur buuneeda aba dooshta. Iidu ghoala buuneeda niny aba dooshta ea ghami, gawuurji gidaghayi nyaashta ng'asheanda siida ASEETA damanda weah sugoocheanda nea gagal headaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabeada gidaghayi rukusiinda siida ASEETA sugoocheanda, gideaba. “Gilooyda nyiit nibiyeenya bea nganooyda siguura shayiiri gajeakghaasa shiliingajeanda, ea giisiiteeniida bea dearanga miyaasiin bea ngaano gajeakghaasa shiliingajeanda, nih gichea gawuurji gil numuji damanda uurji nih, aba dooshta Samariya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha shirikarajeandida hawiin ghuuta siida ASEETA nea gwayeesha, “Ng'ula ghamneawa NG'UTAMIIDA inyeesa gwasin seawuutka humng'eeda, heapi? Ng'asheanji gaygwasa?” Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula ang'iing'i gaydaaha aba gheanyangaagu ak ea majaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasa gawuurji gidasirukusiinda; ak ghoala buuneeda aba dooshta ea ghami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
